 "How we know": "",
 "<0>Early layers (≈ {#}–{#})</0>": "",
 "Tend to work on the surface: token identity, nearby words, fixing up multi-token words, simple syntax. Many \"previous-token\" style heads.": "",
 "<0>Middle layers (≈ {#}–{#})</0>": "",
 "Tend to build richer meaning: who-did-what, entities, facts recalled from FFN \"memories\" (<0>key-value memory</0>), long-range links.": "",
 "<0>Late layers (≈ {#}–{#})</0>": "",
 "Tend to turn that into a prediction: assemble the next-token candidates, sharpen or calibrate the distribution.": "",
